---
const certifications = [
  { name: 'VMware VCP', meta: 'Foundation 6.7' },
  { name: 'WatchGuard', meta: 'Base + Advanced' },
  { name: 'MikroTik', meta: 'MTCNA' },
  { name: 'Proxmox', meta: 'Certified' },
  { name: 'Wasabi S3', meta: 'Certified Partner' },
  { name: 'Libraesva ESG', meta: 'Certified' },
  { name: 'Syneto', meta: 'Certified' },
  { name: 'Microsoft Azure', meta: 'AZ-900 in corso' },
  { name: 'Parallels RAS', meta: 'In corso' },
];
---

<section class="section" id="chi-sono">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-num">— 03 Profilo</span>
    <h2>Quando mi contatti, <span class="accent">parli con me.</span></h2>

    <div class="bio-grid">
      <div class="bio-content">
        <p>
          Ho iniziato a lavorare nell'IT nei primi anni 2010, gestendo infrastrutture
          per piccole realtà manifatturiere della provincia di Varese. Da lì non mi sono
          più fermato: data center, virtualizzazione, sicurezza perimetrale, cloud ibrido.
        </p>
        <p>
          RM-Solution è la formalizzazione di questo percorso. Niente team commerciale,
          niente call center, niente intermediari. Quando mi contatti, rispondo io —
          e se prendo un impegno, lo porto a termine io.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bio-card">
        <div class="bio-avatar">MR</div>
        <div class="bio-name">Marco Regalia</div>
        <div class="bio-role">Senior System Administrator</div>
        <div class="bio-role">Cloud & Infrastructure Architect</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cert-section">
      <span class="cert-label">— Certificazioni attive</span>
      <div class="cert-grid">
        {certifications.map((c) => (
          <div class="cert">
            <div class="cert-check">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="20,6 9,17 4,12" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="cert-name">{c.name}</div>
              <div class="cert-meta">{c.meta}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bio-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 280px;
    gap: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .bio-content p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    max-width: 540px;
  }
  .bio-card {
    background: var(--bg-dark);
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 28px 24px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .bio-card::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -40px;
    right: -40px;
    width: 140px; height: 140px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(30, 144, 255, 0.2) 0%, transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .bio-avatar {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--blue);
    color: #fff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto 16px;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .bio-name {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    color: #fff;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }
  .bio-role {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text-light-soft);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 1.5;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .cert-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--blue-deep);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 500;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .cert-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .cert {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .cert-check {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    background: var(--blue-bg);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--blue-deep);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .cert-name {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  .cert-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .bio-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .cert-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 460px) {
    .cert-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
